# UX / UI — Eco Organic Store

Design like a Sr. UX/UI designer for an organic grocer: calm, tactile, trustworthy. Cream paper, not generic SaaS dark-on-white.

## Brand tokens

| Token | Use |
|---|---|
| Paper `#f8f6f1` | Page background |
| Forest `#047857` / `#065f46` | Primary actions, header wordmark |
| Olive / emerald-100 | Borders, chips |
| Terracotta `#c2410c` | Sparse accent (sale, low-stock, errors) |
| Slate 600/800 | Body / headings |

Headlines: serif or a distinctive display (`font-semibold` large tracking). Body: Inter / system sans. Generous whitespace. `max-w-6xl` content. Sticky header with search + cart badge.

Photography: large produce images, `object-cover`, rounded-xl. Always meaningful `alt` (product name, not "image").

## Components

- Primary button: forest fill, white text, `rounded-lg`, visible `:focus-visible` ring.
- Cards: white on paper, `border-emerald-100`, light shadow.
- Price: `₹{(paise / 100).toFixed(2)}`.
- Qty: keyboard-accessible stepper (`aria-label`), not only a raw number input.
- Toast / `aria-live` polite region on add-to-cart.

## States (never ship a blank gap)

- **Loading** — skeleton that matches the card/PDP layout (not only "Loading...").
- **Empty** — human copy + CTA (e.g. cart → Shop).
- **Error** — recoverable message; listing pages must still render chrome.
- **Disabled** — checkout when cart empty; add-to-cart when unavailable.

## Flows

- Home: hero, featured, category tiles, why-organic, testimonials.
- Shop: filter/sort/search; availability badge from inventory join (omit if unknown).
- PDP: gallery, origin, certifications, qty, reviews.
- Admin: denser tables, still store colors — dashboard first (today's orders, low stock, hidden reviews).

## A11y

Visible focus, contrast ≥ WCAG AA, label every input, do not use color alone for stock/status. Verify UI changes in the browser (desktop + a narrow viewport), not by screenshot only.
